:: Alley {"position":"2027,698","size":"100,100"}
(if: $bess_follow is true)[Bess shakes her head, refusing to go into the dark alley.

"Not safe there, dear."


[[That's fair.->Street]] ](else:)[I'm in a dark, dirty alleyway. (if: $alley_ambush_comment is false)[Perfect for an ambush.(set: $alley_ambush_comment to true)]

There's a [[dumpster]].(if: $backup is "maggie")[

I can see Maggie lurking behind the dumpster. She's in position to ambush the vampire once I lure it out.](elseif: $backup is "luke")[

I can see Luke lurking behind the dumpster. He's in position to ambush the vampire once I lure it out.]

Lamplight behind me leads the way back to the |street>[street].


|wait>[Wait](click: ?wait)[(set: $LongTick to true)(go-to: "Alley")]
(set: $sequence to 0)
(set: $Current_Location to "Alley")]
(click: ?street)[(set: $triggerNorm to true)(set: $Tick to true)(go-to: "Street")]


:: Alley Plan {"position":"2241,1127","size":"100,100"}
(if: $inv_stake is true)[ (if: $cig_in_vamp_eye is true)[[[Stake him.->Stake him success]] ](else:)[[[Stake him.->Stake him. failure]]  ] ](else:)[  |stake>[<span class="dimLink">Stake him.</span>]    |stakeFail>[](click: ?stake)[(replace: ?stakeFail)[//I don't have a stake.//] ] ]

(if: $inv_bucket_contains is "holy_water")[ [[Throw a bucket of holy water at him.]] ](else:)[  |bucket>[<span class="dimLink">Throw a bucket of holy water at him.</span>]    |bucketFail>[](click: ?bucket)[(replace: ?bucketFail)[//I don't have holy water.//] ] ]

(if: $inv_squirt_contains is "holy_water")[ [[Shoot him with my holy water squirt gun.]] ](else:)[  |squirt>[<span class="dimLink">Shoot him with my holy water squirt gun.</span>]    |squirtFail>[](click: ?squirt)[(replace: ?squirtFail)[//I don't have that.//] ] ]

(if: $inv_wreath is true)[ (if: $cig_in_vamp_eye is true)[[[Throw the holly wreath at him.->Throw holly success]] ](else:)[[[Throw the holly wreath at him.->Throw the holly wreath at him.]]  ] ](else:)[  |wreath>[<span class="dimLink">Throw the holly wreath at him.</span>]    |wreathFail>[](click: ?wreath)[(replace: ?wreathFail)[//I don't have that.//] ] ]

[[Wait.->wait alley]]
(set: $sequence to 0)


:: Alley decide {"position":"2373,1774","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[The vampire is following me.
(set: $sequence to 1)
I can take him outside. |private>[Somewhere secluded] where I could kill him without anyone seeing.(click: ?private)[

He's sure to follow because he is trying to get me to go somewhere secluded so HE can kill ME without anyone seeing.]

Or I could not do that and come up with another way of dealing with him inside of the McDonalds.


[[Take him somewhere secluded.->Alley decide]]

[[Dump him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[(set: $sequence to 0)(if: $wreath_hung is true)[I make sure I get to the door first. I gentlemanly hold the door for him.

We have a brief argument over |allowed>[whether women are allowed to hold doors open for men.](click: ?allowed)[

//Good god. I think this guy must have been vampire-ized in the 1950s.//]

I am stubborn, and eventually he shrugs and walks through.

I surreptitiously grab the wreath as I follow him out.
(set: $wreath_hung to false)
(set: $inv_wreath to true)
[[Probably shouldn't have trapped him inside when I was planning to lure him out. Fortunately, I'm smooth.->Lead him to alley.]] ](elseif: $bucket_trap is true)[The vampire opens the door and the bucket of holy water crashes down on his head.


[[Continue->Holy water melt]] ](else:)[(go-to: "Lead him to alley.")] ]


:: And then he disintegrated {"position":"172,2496","size":"100,100"}
And then he...disintegrated.

Like in a movie.

He just turned to ash.

I was screaming.


[[The woman looked at me.->CalmLeaveTest]]  


:: Approach Cashier {"position":"1026,937","size":"100,100"}
(if: $bess_follow is true)[The cashier seems a little leery of Bess. I don't want to get us thrown out, so I keep my distance.


[[Discrimination against the homeless is a sad reality of our world.->Main Room]] ](else:)[I walk up to the adorable cashier. She smiles at me.

"Hi! Can I get you something?"


(if: $food_orders < 3)[ [[Order food.->Order]] ](else:)[  |attempt>[<span class="dimLink">Order food.</span>]    |attemptFail>[](click: ?attempt)[(replace: ?attemptFail)[//I couldn't eat another bite.//] ] ](if: $talked_to_cashier is false)[

[[Warn her.->Talk To Cashier]] ] 

[[Say nevermind and go do something else.->Main Room]] ]


:: Arson from the street {"position":"846,2625","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[I run out to the street.
(set: $sequence to 1)
I stop and look back. I can still see the interior through the glass doors.

The vampire emerges from the kitchen in a sprint.

He snarls in fear at the fire, but [[sees a clear path to the exit.->Arson from the street]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[(if: $wreath_hung is true)[He reaches front door, but recoils when he sees the holly wreath.

He flinches back into reach of the fire, and burns like tissue paper in the blaze.
(set: $EnthusiasticallyFired to true)
Vampires are very flammable.

A few seconds later the cashier emerges, panting, from the back.

I pull the door open for her.

[[I make sure she's all right.->death ending]]  ](else:)[He reaches the front door, smashes through it, and flees into the night.

The cashier emerges in his wake, panting.

[[I make sure she's all right.->drive off ending]] ] ]


:: Arson from the street, cashier dies {"position":"678,2622","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[I run out to the street.
(set: $sequence to 1)
I stop and look back. I can still see the interior through the glass doors.

The vampire sprints out from the kitchen.

But he stops, shrieking, his way blocked by the burning counter.

Got him!

[[But then...->Arson from the street, cashier dies]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[The cashier is back there with him.

She can't get out either.

I watch her face as the flame leap higher.

Oh my god, I just.

Oh my god.
(set: $death_hint to "Never again.")
(set: $KilledCashier to true)
[[...->Endings]] ]


:: Ask Bess to banish him. {"position":"1864,1904","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)["Okay." I point at the vampire. "That's the bad guy."

"What do you want me to do, girl?" Bess asks.
(set: $sequence to 1)

[["Quote scripture at him."->Ask Bess to banish him.]]

[["Give him a pamphlet."->Ask Bess to pamphlet him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)["Just what you usually do," I tell her. "Quote pieces of the bible you believe in. And try to do it at him."

I gesture again towards the vampire.

"Aggressively."

"Bible's a book of love," she tells me.
(set: $sequence to 2)

[["Be aggressively loving."->Ask Bess to banish him.]]

[["Well he's made of hate. So that will melt him."->Ask Bess to banish him.]]

[["Don't worry about the details, just trust me."->Ask Bess to banish him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[Bess shrugs and trundles her cart over the vampire.

The vampire passively ignores Bess until she stops by his table.

Then he aggressively ignores her, crossing his arms and staring pointedly in a different direction.

Serious "Fuck off" body language. Guess she doesn't meet his snack standards.
(set: $sequence to 3)

[[Elitist jerk.->Ask Bess to banish him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)[Bess is not flustered by this. She folds her hands, looks at him, and starts to speak.

"Behold, you are beautiful, my love;
    behold, you are beautiful;
    your eyes are doves."

"Behold, you are..."
(set: $sequence to 4)

[[Watch->Ask Bess to banish him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[The vampire flinch-jumps like a cat who's just had the sprinkler system go on under it.

At the end of this full-body spasm of reflexive panic he is backed up against the wall, with all the booth between him and Bess.

He stares at her, shocked and affronted.

Bess blinks in surprise, and then watches him thoughtfully.
(set: $sequence to 5)

[[Watch->Ask Bess to banish him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 5)["Uh," the cashier says uncertainly. "Please don't bother other customers."

Bess glances at her, but seems |annoyed>[intensely irritated by the vampire's reaction to scripture.](click: ?annoyed)[

//This is common among the devout. Even if unaware of the true nature of the unholy monsters they face, they tend to be instinctively ticked off by the buggers.//]

She continues.

"Behold, you are beautiful, my beloved, truly delightful.
	Our couch is green;
	the beams of our house are cedar;
    our rafters are..."

The vampire launches himself over the table and vaults over booths, trying to get away, [[running towards the door.->heads towards the door.]] ]


:: Ask Bess to pamphlet him. {"position":"1993,1901","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 1)["Just give him a pamphlet," I tell her. That should be enough to freak him out.

Bess shrugs and trundles her cart over the vampire.
(set: $sequence to 2)

[[Watch->Ask Bess to pamphlet him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[Bess shrugs and trundles her cart over the vampire.

The vampire passively ignores Bess until she stops by his table.

Then he aggressively ignores her, crossing his arms and staring pointedly in a different direction.

Serious "Fuck off" body language. Guess she doesn't meet his snack standards.
(set: $sequence to 3)

[[Elitist jerk.->Ask Bess to banish him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)[Bess is not flustered by this. She shuffles out a pamphlet and offers it to him with a smile and a quote:

"Behold, you are beautiful, my love;
    behold, you are beautiful;
    your eyes are doves."

"Behold, you are..."
(set: $sequence to 4)

[[Watch->Ask Bess to banish him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[The vampire flinch-jumps like a cat who's just had the sprinkler system go on under it.

At the end of this full-body spasm of reflexive panic he is backed up against the wall, with all the booth between him and Bess.

He stares at her, shocked and affronted.

Bess blinks in surprise, and then watches him thoughtfully.
(set: $sequence to 5)

[[Watch->Ask Bess to banish him.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 5)["Uh," the cashier says uncertainly. "Please don't bother other customers."

Bess glances at her, but seems |annoyed>[intensely irritated by the vampire's reaction to scripture.](click: ?annoyed)[

//This is common among the devout. Even if unaware of the true nature of the unholy monsters they face, they tend to be instinctively ticked off by the buggers.//]

She thrusts the pamphlet towards the vampire and continues with her quote.

"Behold, you are beautiful, my beloved, truly delightful.
	Our couch is green;
	the beams of our house are cedar;
    our rafters are..."

The vampire launches himself over the table and vaults over booths, trying to get away, [[running towards the door.->heads towards the door.]] ]


:: Banish him with a Jesus pamphlet. {"position":"2259,1922","size":"100,100"}
Yeah I have religious text.

But I'm agnostic.

You need to be really zealous to banish someone with religious text.

I'm just kind of wishy-washy.


[[Agnostic vampire hunter.->approach vampire booth]]


:: Bathroom {"position":"2774,726","size":"100,100"}
(if: $bess_follow is true)[I'm not taking Bess into the bathroom with me. That would be weird.


[[Don't want to be weird.->Main Room]] ](else:)[It's a one room bathroom. Relatively clean.

There's a [[sink]], a [[toilet]], and a [[paper towel dispenser]].

(if: $closet_open is false)[There's a [[small gray supply cabinet->supply cabinet]] in one wall.

](else:)[The [[supply cabinet]] is open.

](if: $sanitizer_taken is false)[An [[air sanitizer]] is plugged into the wall.

]A door leads back to the |main>[McDonalds proper].


|wait>[Wait](click: ?wait)[(set: $Tick to true)(go-to: "Bathroom")]

(set: $sequence to 0)
(click: ?main)[(set: $Tick to true)(go-to: "Main Room")]
(set: $Current_Location to "Bathroom")]


:: Bless Water {"position":"1444,1238","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 1)["Bless?" her eyes widen. "I'm not a priest."

"It doesn't matter," I tell her. "You believe."
(set: $sequence to 2)

[[Continue->Bless Water]]  ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[(if: $inv_salt is true)["You need salt, dear," she tells me. "Can't be only water. It needs salt."

"Got that," I say, producing the bit of salt I got off my fries and giving it to her.
(set: $sequence to 3)

[[Continue->Bless Water]] ](else:)["You need salt, dear," she tells me. "Can't be only water. It needs salt."

"Oh," I say. "Crap. I'll be back."


[[Go find salt.->Street]] ] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)[The woman touches the water in the mop bucket with her fingertip.
(set: $Tick to true)
"The Blessing of the Father Almighty be upon this Creature of Salt, and let all malignity and hindrance be cast forth hence from, and let all good enter herein, for without Thee man cannot live, wherefore I bless thee and invoke thee, that thou mayest aid me."

She sprinkles the salt into the water and recites more prayers. Then she gives it to me.

"I hope it does good," she says.

"It will," I promise.
(set: $inv_bucket_contains to "holy_water")
(set: $homeless_attitude to 7)
[[Holy water got!->Street]] ]


