:: Call_Inventory_Maggie {"position":"1578,337","size":"100,100"}
(if: $backup is "luke")[I don't need to call Maggie. Luke's already on his way.


[[< Back To Cellphone->Inventory_detail]] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 0)[I love Maggie, but I don't want to interrupt her night if I don't have anything new to tell her.


[[< Back To Cellphone->Inventory_detail]] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 1)[''Maggie:'' "Hey sweetie."
(set: $MaggieTalk to 2)
''Lucy:'' "Hello darling."

''Maggie:'' "How's your night off?"

''Lucy:'' "I'm trying to figure out what to DO with it."

''Maggie:'' "Get your nails done. You love that."(if: $mani_pedi_color is not "none")[

''Lucy:'' "Already done."

''Maggie:'' "See? I know you so well."]


[[< Back To Cellphone->Inventory_detail]] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 2)[''Maggie:'' "Hey sweetie. What's up?"
(set: $MaggieTalk to 0)
''Lucy:'' "I just love hearing your voice."

''Lucy:'' "I love how you sound and look like Tinkerbell."

''Lucy:'' "And I love how you sound and look like her even when you're twisting a vampire's head off like a bottle cap."

''Lucy:'' "It's the most awesome thing."

''Maggie:'' "Aww. I love you too."


[[< Back To Cellphone->Inventory_detail]] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 3)[''Lucy:'' "Hey Maggie."

''Maggie:'' "Hey sweetheart. Everything okay? You sound stressed."


|vamp_help>[''Lucy:'' "Yeah. Guess what I ran into on my night off? A fucking vampire."]
(click: ?vamp_help)[(set: $MaggieTalk to 8)(go-to: "Call_Inventory_Maggie")]
|moral>[''Lucy:'' "Nothing I can't handle. Just calling for some moral support."]
(click: ?moral)[(set: $MaggieTalk to 4)(go-to: "Call_Inventory_Maggie")] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 4)[''Maggie:'' "Sure thing. You're smart and sweet and sexy and can totally handle anything life gets bitchy about."
(set: $MaggieTalk to 5)

[[''Lucy:'' "And my tummy is cute, right?"->Call_Inventory_Maggie]] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 5)[''Maggie:'' "Your tummy is the most adorable little buddha tummy ever."

''Maggie:'' "Guys and girls fawn over your tummy."

''Maggie:'' "Your tummy is like that Greek woman's face."

''Maggie:'' "Thousand ship tummy."


|helen>[''Lucy:'' "Helen of Troy."]
(click: ?helen)[(set: $MaggieTalk to 6)(go-to: "Call_Inventory_Maggie")]
|thanks>[''Lucy:'' "Thanks Maggie. You're a darling."]
(click: ?thanks)[(set: $MaggieTalk to 7)(go-to: "Call_Inventory_Maggie")] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 6)[''Maggie:'' "Yeah! Helen of tummy."

''Maggie:'' "Don't start any wars."
(set: $MaggieTalk to 7)

[[''Lucy:'' "Thanks Maggie."->Call_Inventory_Maggie]]

[[''Lucy:'' "I love you, Mags."->Call_Inventory_Maggie]] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 7)[''Maggie:'' "Any time. You have a good night off, you hear?"

''Lucy:'' "Yes ma'am."
(set: $MaggieTalk to 0)

[[< Back To Cellphone->Inventory_detail]] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 8)[''Maggie:'' "Seriously? Where are you?"

''Lucy:'' "McDonalds."

''Maggie:'' "Who hunts at //McDonalds//?"

''Lucy:'' "This skeezball."

''Maggie:'' "You need backup?"


|help>[''Lucy:'' "Yeah. Could you?"]
(click: ?help)[(set: $MaggieTalk to 9)(go-to: "Call_Inventory_Maggie")]
