(click: ?no_help)[(set: $MaggieTalk to 11)(go-to: "Call_Inventory_Maggie")] ](elseif: $MaggieTalk is 9)[''Maggie:'' "Sure thing. I'll grab my machete and head right down. You got an ambush point in mind?"
