:: Claire Dies {"position":"1120,7","size":"100,100"}
(if: $Current_Location is not "Kitchen")[Someone screams.
(set: $Current_Location to "Kitchen")
Female. Young. Terrified.
(set: $DisplayTime to false)
It's coming from the kitchen of the McDonalds.

I break into a run.

[[I arrive too late.->Claire Dies]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 0)[The vampire has the cashier pressed against a juice dispenser.
(set: $death_hint to "Gotta act faster. The vampire will eat the cashier at midnight unless I do something.")
He shifts abruptly from playful kisses to gouging her throat with his canines.

Her screams are cut off as she loses her larynx.

I see her lips convulsing soundlessly as he pushes his tongue into the hole he's made and widens it and sucks.


|attack>[Attack him.]
(click: ?attack)[(set: $death_sequence to 3)(go-to: "Claire Dies")]
|run>[Run.]
(click: ?run)[(set: $death_sequence to 1)(go-to: "Claire Dies")] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 1)[It's the only sane thing to do.
(set: $death_sequence to 2)
He's in a feeding frenzy. If he sees me I'm dead.
(set: $triggerNorm to true)
I have to cut my losses.

I have to get away.

If I survive I can save more people, [[on other nights.->Claire Dies]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 2)[ (go-to: "Run Away") ](elseif: $death_sequence is 3)[I'm seeing red.

It's not just the blood on the floor.

He's stronger than me. He's faster than me. I should be careful and clever.

But I can't. Not right now.

I grab the closest thing at hand that feels like a weapon:
(set: $death_sequence to 0)

[[Fire Extinguisher]]

|broom>[Broom]
(click: ?broom)[(set: $death_sequence to 4)(go-to: "Claire Dies")]
|fry>[Fryer Basket]
(click: ?fry)[(set: $death_sequence to 6)(go-to: "Claire Dies")] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 4)[I grab a broom.
(set: $death_sequence to 5)
I crack it over my leg with strength I wouldn't have if I weren't so angry.

[[I stab the vampire in the heart with it.->Claire Dies]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 5)[The broken end sinks straight into his heart.

Unfortunately, the broom is plastic.

Fucking modern plastic.

You can't stake a vampire with plastic.

[[He turns around and kills me.->Endings]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 6)[I grab a fryer basket, full of fries dripping with hot oil.
(set: $death_sequence to 7)
I swing it two handed at the back of his head with strength I wouldn't have if I weren't so angry.

He chokes on blood as it brands the side of his face with a [[crosshatch of burns.->Claire Dies]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 7)[But it's not heavy enough to do real damage.

And in his frenzy he ignores the pain.

[[He turns around and kills me.->Endings]] ]


