:: Dodge out of the way. {"position":"2241,995","size":"100,100"}
I dodge out of the way. He's not expecting this, so I manage it.

He smirks at me, amused at my resistance. He thinks he's lured me into a trap.

[[How am I going to disabuse him of that notion?->Alley Plan]]


:: Dump him. {"position":"2506,1769","size":"100,100"}
"You know what, actually, nevermind," I say.

"What?" says the vampire.

"Don't want to go anywhere alone with you."

"What? You think I'm going to pull something?" He seems genuinely indignant. "Not all men are like that, you bitch."

"Did you seriously just..." I shake my head. "Nevermind. Just, go away."

"You lead me on, and now you're dumping me?"

"Lead you on? We were talking for, like, less than a minute."

"Whatever."

The vampire glares at me, then stalks back to his booth.
(set: $dump_vamp to true)

[[Wow. That was awful. I really want to kill him now.->Main Room]]


