:: Fire Extinguisher {"position":"1253,17","size":"100,100"}
(if: $death_sequence is 0)[I grab a fire extinguisher.

I swing it with strength I wouldn't have if I weren't so angry.

What am I aiming for?


|head>[Head.]
(click: ?head)[(set: $death_sequence to 3)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")]
|body>[Body.]
(click: ?body)[(set: $death_sequence to 1)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")]
|legs>[Legs.]
(click: ?legs)[(set: $death_sequence to 8)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 1)[I hit him in the body.

The weight of the extinguisher and my anger-strength are enough to knock him sprawling.

The cashier flops like a rag doll as the vampire picks himself up.
(set: $death_sequence to 2)

[[Keep hitting him.->Fire Extinguisher]]

[[Help the cashier.->Fire Extinguisher]]

[[Run.->Fire Extinguisher]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 2)[Unfortunately, it doesn't matter what I do.

The body-shot wasn't enough to stop him for more than a moment.

And now he's noticed me.

[[He gets up and kills me.->Endings]]  ](elseif: $death_sequence is 3)[I hit him in the head.

The weight of the extinguisher and my anger-strength let me smash it overhand into his skull.

I *feel* bone crack.

The cashier flops like a rag doll as the vampire stumbles.


|hit>[Keep hitting him.]
(click: ?hit)[(set: $death_sequence to 4)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")]
|help>[Help the cashier.]
(click: ?help)[(set: $death_sequence to 6)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")]
|run>[Run.]
(click: ?run)[(set: $death_sequence to 12)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 4)[I keep whaling on him with the extinguisher.
(set: $death_sequence to 5)
Turns out even the undead need brains.

[[I turn his to a pulp.->Fire Extinguisher]]](elseif: $death_sequence is 5)[He's dead. Whatever. I kneel down by the cashier.

I can't tell if she's dead yet. She's bleeding a lot. That means her heart's still beating.

I pull out my phone and call 911.

I don't know if she's dead.

We'll see.
(set: $SnickerSmash to true)
[[What a fucking night.->Endings]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 6)[I grab the cashier.

I run.

The vamprie tries to chase us. Even with a dent in his skull his legs still work, and I'm carrying a body.

He grabs my arm.

[[He kills me.->Endings]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 7)[I'm fighting a frenzied vampire with nothing but kitchen supplies.

I go suddenly sane and get the hell out of there.

The vamprie tries to chase us. Even with a dent in his skull his legs still work, but I'm faster.
(set: $triggerNorm to true)
[[I get out.->Run Away]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 8)[I hit him in the legs.

The weight of the extinguisher and my anger-strength let me smash the metal through his leg and into the ground. I *feel* the bone snap.

The cashier flops like a rag doll as the vampire hisses on the floor.


|hit>[Keep hitting him.]
(click: ?hit)[(set: $death_sequence to 9)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")]
|help>[Help the cashier.]
(click: ?help)[(set: $death_sequence to 10)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")]
|run>[Run.]
(click: ?run)[(set: $death_sequence to 12)(go-to: "Fire Extinguisher")] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 9)[I keep whaling on him with the extinguisher.

But angry as I am, I'm slow, and even without his legs, he's fast.

He grabs me and pulls me down to the floor.

I lose the grapple fast.

[[He kills me.->Endings]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 10)[I grab the cashier.
(set: $death_sequence to 11)
I run.
(set: $triggerNorm to true)
The vamprie tries to chase us, but with a broken leg, he can't.

[[We get out.->Fire Extinguisher]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 11)[Two blocks away, I stop.

The homeless woman is helping me carry the cashier. I didn't even notice.

We lay her down on the ground.

I can't tell if she's dead yet. She's bleeding a lot. That means her heart's still beating.

The homeless woman presses my jacket against her throat and I call a hospital.

I don't know if she's dead.

We'll see.

He's still out there.

[[What a fucking night.->Endings]] ](elseif: $death_sequence is 12)[I'm fighting a frenzied vampire with nothing but kitchen supplies.
(set: $triggerNorm to true)
I go suddenly sane and [[get the hell out of there.->Run Away]] ]


