:: Lucy_dies {"position":"1862,2369","size":"100,100"}
(if: $inv_necklace is true)[He moves fast, lunging for my throat.

Then he sees, or feels, by cross necklace, and recoils.

He jumps back.

He stares at me, and I see in his eyes a moment of realization.

He understand that I know what he is, and that I have weapons to fight him.

(if: $Current_Location is "Kitchen")[He runs back to the main room. [[I chase him.->heads towards the door.]] 

The cashier blearily staggers after us, murmuring something about today's specials.](elseif: $Current_Location is "Main Room")[ [[He turns to run.->heads towards the door.]] ](else:)[ [[He flees into the night.->drive off ending]] ] ](else:)[He moves so fast his teeth are in my throat before I have time to yell.

He bites so deep his fangs scrape my collarbone.

He rips it out. It clatters to the bloody floor.

Followed quickly by my body.


[[The End.->Endings]] ]


