:: Make a cross necklace. {"position":"1429,1632","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[I'll need string to tie the crosses together into a necklace.

What should I use to make the string?


(if: $inv_paper_count > 1)[ |towels>[Paper towels.] (click: ?towels)[(set: $sequence to 1)(go-to: "Make a cross necklace.")] ](else:)[  |towels>[<span class="dimLink">Paper towels.</span>]    |towelsFail>[](click: ?towels)[(replace: ?towelsFail)[//I don't have enough. I would need at least two.//] ] ]

(if: $inv_pam is true)[ |pam>[Religious pamphlet.] (click: ?pam)[(set: $sequence to 2)(go-to: "Make a cross necklace.")] ](else:)[  |pam>[<span class="dimLink">Religious pamphlet.</span>]    |pamFail>[](click: ?pam)[(replace: ?pamFail)[//I don't have that.//] ] ]

(if: $inv_wreath is true)[ |wreath>[Wreath.] (click: ?wreath)[(set: $sequence to 3)(go-to: "Make a cross necklace.")] ](else:)[  |wreath>[<span class="dimLink">Wreath.</span>]    |wreathFail>[](click: ?wreath)[(replace: ?wreathFail)[//I don't have that.//] ] ] 

[[Nevermind.->booth]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[I take a couple of my paper towels and I roll them up so that they're long and narrow. I tie the ends together.

I try to tie it around one of my straw-crosses.

Unfortunately, it's too delicate, and falls apart.
(set: $Tick to true)(set: $sequence to 0)(set: $inv_paper_count to $inv_paper_count - 2)

[[Darn.->Make a cross necklace.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[I take the Jesus pamphlet out of my pocket.

I unfold it completely and roll it up tight so that it's long and narrow.

I try to tie it around one of my straw-crosses.

It's thin enough that I can bend it like twine, but thick enough that it doesn't fall apart.

Plus, it adds extra religion to my necklace.
(set: $sequence to 4)
(set: $inv_pam to false)
[[Score.->Make a cross necklace.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)[I pick at the wreath, trying to unwrap some of the branches to see if they're long enough to make a necklace.

It turns out they're glued together pretty tightly, and when I manage to peel a branch, it just flakes off in twigs.

Also, holly is sharp.
(set: $Tick to true)(set: $sequence to 0)

[[Ow.->Make a cross necklace.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[I select the best of my drinking straw crosses and string them together with the pamphlet-twine.

The result looks like something out of Van Helsing's Kindergarten and Daycare, but it might just save my life, so I put it on. 
(set: $inv_necklace to true)

[[Continue->booth]] ]


