:: McDonalds {"position":"254,636","size":"100,100"}
I push through the door and inhale the smell of fried grease. I also feel a thin layer of it settling over my skin. The lights are bright and tinted orange.

It's a one room restaurant. Booths line the walls leading up to the counter.

One lonely cashier sits at the far right end.

One lonely customer slouches in the booth nearest her.

[[I sidle up and order a Big Mac.->order_first]]


:: McDonalds Transition {"position":"254,486","size":"100,100"}
Great idea. The best way to unwind is to eat delicious, delicious, unhealthy food.

Also cheap food. This may surprise you, but [[vampire hunting does not pay well.]]

We eat a lot of pasta cooked on motel stoves. And when the motels don't have kitchenettes, it's rice and beans in a pressure cooker Luke keeps in the van next to the gun rack.

Anyway. The point is that McDonalds is a treat.

Don't judge me.


|continue>[Continue]
(click: ?continue)[(set: $triggerMcDon to true)(go-to: "McDonalds")]




