:: Open Sorcery_Menu {"position":"409,306","size":"100,100"}
**Open Sorcery**
(set: $SkipSave to true)
A game about technology, magic and becoming a person.

<a target="_blank" style="color: goldenrod;" href='http://abigailcorfman.com/Home/OpenSorcery'>Click Here To Play</a>

Open Sorcery is text-based. It follows the development of an elemental firewall. A creature of intertwined magic and code.

There are 90,000 words of text, five animated sequences, eighteen achievements to pursue, and eight possible endings.

In this game you can:

* Search for malicious spirits
* Protect your network
* Make friends
* Burn everything
* Learn
* Dream
* Become sapient


