:: Seriously {"position":"101,171","size":"100,100"}
Seriously. I can't show neck in a bar without someone tall, dark and anemic sidling up to me and staring at my breasts to keep himself from ogling my jugular.

Which is good. For us. Sort of.

Well, it means we're where we're supposed to be. Fighting the good fight. Keeping drunk college students safe. One oversized, undead mosquito at a time.

But it's [[tiring work|Tiring Work]].


