(if: $inv_pam is true)[ |pamphlet>[The pamphlet.] (click: ?pamphlet)[(set: $sequence to 3)(go-to: "Stop up the toilet.")]  ](else:)[  |pamphlet>[<span class="dimLink">The pamphlet.</span>]    |pamphletFail>[](click: ?pamphlet)[(replace: ?pamphletFail)[//I don't have that.//] ] ]

[[Nevermind.->Bathroom]]  ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[I stuff $inv_paper_count paper towels into the toilet.(if: $inv_paper_count > 20)[

It takes a while. I have a lot of paper towels.]
(set: $sequence to 0)
I flush.
(set: $sequence to 0)(set: $toilet_paper_count to $toilet_paper_count + $inv_paper_count)(set: $inv_paper_count to 0)
(if: $toilet_wreath is false)[The toilet flushes successfully. All my precious paper towels vanish down the tubes.

Darn it. This toilet is more powerful than I had anticipated.

I'll need to find something really awful to wedge in there so that the paper can't go down, but the water can still come up.
(set: $toilet_paper_count to 0)

[[Continue to stop up the toilet.->Stop up the toilet.]] ](elseif: $toilet_paper_count < 30)[The toilet gurgles, and the paper towels get stuck in the wreath.

It still flushes, though. I need more.


[[Continue to stop up the toilet.->Stop up the toilet.]] ](else:)[The toilet gurgles distressingly.

