(set: $inv_wreath to false)(set: $toilet_wreath to true)
In the end, I have a festive blockage that lets water up, but doesn't let anything else properly flush.


[[Continue to stop up the toilet.->Stop up the toilet.]] 


](elseif: $sequence is 3)[This thing has Jesus on it...
(set: $sequence to 0)
