:: The man talked to me. {"position":"312,2127","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[The man came up and started talking to me.
(set: $sequence to 1)
I asked him if he wanted to order something.

He asked if I was on the menu.

No one had ever said anything like that to me before.

He looked kind of old, but then I looked into his eyes.

I realized how beautiful they were.

I realized how handsome he was.


[[Continue->The man talked to me.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[Things got blurry after that.

I don't remember a lot.

I remember his voice. It was really smooth.

We ended up in the kitchen.

He was kissing me.

He was kissing me like I was the only girl in the world. Like he wanted to devour me.

Then...


|dust>[He turned to dust.]
(click: ?dust)[(set: $sequence to 2)(go-to: "The man talked to me.")]
|burn>[He burned to death.]
(click: ?burn)[(set: $sequence to 3)(go-to: "The man talked to me.")]
|fire>[The fire alarm went off.]
(click: ?fire)[(set: $sequence to 4)(go-to: "The man talked to me.")]
|douse>[Someone threw a bucket of water on us.]
(click: ?douse)[(set: $sequence to 5)(go-to: "The man talked to me.")]
|bite>[He bit me.]
(click: ?bite)[(set: $sequence to 6)(go-to: "The man talked to me.")] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[He turned to dust.

I felt him turn to dust.

I was covered in dust that used to be him.

The woman was standing over me.

I think was screaming.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You staked the vampire.")

[[The woman looked at me.->CalmLeaveTest]] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)[He dropped me.

He was suddenly standing and snarling.

And the woman was there, and she threw...she threw fire at him. And then she was gone. Ran away.

And I watched him burn.

Just seconds ago I was kissing him.

And then I watched him burn to death.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with fire.")

[[Continue->Therapy]] ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[The fire alarm went off and the sprinklers started up.

He dropped me and ran, and it took me a second because I was really lightheaded, but I ran too.

The front room was on FIRE. Like, I didn't even think about getting the fire extinguisher, I just got OUT of there.

The guy was gone when I got outside.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You burned down the McDonalds.")
I never saw him again.


[[The End->Unlockables]] ](elseif: $sequence is 5)[We were kissing, and then suddenly we were soaked.

And he was MELTING.

I could feel him melting.

His skin felt like skin, and then it felt like mud.

And then he just melted on top of me.

And I started screaming.

And the woman got me some paper towels.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with holy water.")

[[Continue->Therapy]] ](elseif: $sequence is 6)[He bit me.
(set: $sequence to 7)
Everything went from blurry and nice to blurry and bad.

Like, I could tell something bad was happening. I was losing something important.

Blood. I was losing blood.

He was drinking my blood.

I was dying.


[[Then the woman hit him with a fire extinguisher.->The man talked to me.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 7)[I don't remember anything after that.
(set: $sequence to 8)
I woke up in a hospital.

The woman was gone.

Mom didn't believe me about what happened.

But I knew what happened.

I'd been attacked by a monster.

A monster that looked like a person.


[[Continue->The man talked to me.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 8)[I tried to go back to school and back to work, but I couldn't.
(set: $sequence to 9)
I had nightmares about him kissing me.

I left town last Saturday.

I have all my savings in my pocket.

The guy from Motel 6 told me a pretty girl and her two friends left town, heading north.


[[Continue->The man talked to me.]]  ](elseif: $sequence is 9)[I'm getting on a bus to the next town north.

I'm going to find her.

I'm going to find out what happened.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire by bashing in his head. Claire becomes a vampire hunter.")

[[The End->Unlockables]] ]


:: The toilet started acting up. {"position":"51,2118","size":"100,100"}
I noticed it when I saw water was leaking out from the bathroom.

And in my head I was like: OH NO. SUE, WHY ARE YOU GONE?

Sue knows how to fix toilets. Her dad's a plumber.

But she wasn't here so I went inside.

It turned out someone had stuffed a CHRISTMAS WREATH into the toilet.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You banished the vampire by breaking a toilet.")
[[WTF?->Weird Ignorance]]


:: The woman and man talked to each other. {"position":"182,2120","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[The man went over and started talking to the woman.
(set: $sequence to 1)
They were flirting. It was really obvious.

I tried to imagine what it would be like to be her, to have men flirt with me.


[[Continue->The woman and man talked to each other.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[The left together.

And like, that's not weird by itself. That's not weird at all.

But then I heard something really weird from outside.

Like maybe screaming? Or hissing? Or a gunshot?

I don't know. I was thinking about calling the police.

But then it stopped, so I didn't.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire in the alley.")

[[Continue->Weird Ignorance]] ]


:: The woman did something...weird. {"position":"55,2250","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[Then the woman did something...

...weird.


|straw>[She started making tons of tiny crosses out of drinking straws.]
(click: ?straw)[(set: $sequence to 1)(go-to: "The woman did something...weird.")]
|neck>[She made a cross necklace out of straws and hugged the guy.]
(click: ?neck)[(set: $sequence to 3)(go-to: "The woman did something...weird.")]
|uv>[She stole the UV sanitizer from the bathroom.]
(click: ?uv)[(set: $sequence to 4)(go-to: "The woman did something...weird.")]
|home>[She brought in a homeless woman.]
(click: ?home)[(set: $sequence to 5)(go-to: "The woman did something...weird.")]
|bucket>[She filled a yellow mop bucket with water.]
(click: ?bucket)[(set: $sequence to 7)(go-to: "The woman did something...weird.")] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[She was really enthusiastic about those crosses.
(set: $sequence to 2)
She like, lined the edge of her table with them.

And I think the other guy was like, an atheist or something, because he kept giving her weird looks.

And then he got up to leave.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You banished the vampire with crosses.")

|wreath>[But he couldn't because she'd hung up the old Christmas wreath and apparently he hated Christmas?]
(click: ?wreath)[(set: $sequence to 2)(go-to: "The woman did something...weird.")]
[[He just left.->Weird Ignorance]] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[He did this really weird thing, like he was freaked out by the crosses and the wreath, and he didn't want to be near either of them.

And then he...exploded.

And I kind of freaked out.

I mean a guy just freaking exploded!
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with the wreath.")

[[The woman looked at me.->CalmLeaveTest]] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)[She made this weird hand-crafted necklace out of straws and rolled up papers.

Then she walked over to the guy and hugged him. Just out of the blue.

And then he...disintegrated.

Like in a movie.

He just turned to ash.

I was screaming.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with crosses.")

[[The woman looked at me.->CalmLeaveTest]]  ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[I guess she didn't really STEAL the sanitizer.

She just moved it to the main room.

I guess she was afraid of germs?

I didn't want to make a big deal out of it.

And then the guy started screaming.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with 'sunlight'.")

[[Continue->And then he disintegrated]] ](elseif: $sequence is 5)[There's this homeless woman who likes hanging around outside.

I think her name is Bess.

Usually the manager tells her to go away, but he's not here and I don't do that.

The woman brings her inside. I guess she's gonna buy her dinner or something?

But then the homeless woman starts bothering the guy.

I thought maybe I should stop her, but I felt really awkward about it.

Then he got up to leave.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You banished the vampire with true faith.")

|wreath>[But for some reason he couldn't.]
(click: ?wreath)[(set: $sequence to 6)(go-to: "The woman did something...weird.")]
[[He just left.->Weird Ignorance]]  ](elseif: $sequence is 6)[He couldn't leave, and he was staring at the homeless woman, and she started saying some REALLY weird stuff about veils and gazelles.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with true faith.")
And then...

Then he MELTED.

Like the wicked witch of the west.

And the homeless woman just stood there and was calm.

And he had MELTED.

And I think I was screaming. 

[[And the woman looked at me.->CalmLeaveTest]]  ](elseif: $sequence is 7)[I saw the woman carrying a big yellow mop bucket.
(set: $sequence to 8)
I think it was the one Sue broke yesterday.

I guess the woman fixed it?

And put water in it?

Did she want to mop something?


[[Continue->The woman did something...weird.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 8)[Then something made the guy want to leave.
(set: $sequence to 9)
And as he was opening the door, the bucket fell on him.

Like, this woman had made a bucket trap prank out of the broken mop bucket.

And then...

[[He melted.->The woman did something...weird.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 9)[He melted.

Like the wicked witch of the west.

And the only thing left was his jacket.

He had MELTED.

And I think I was screaming.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with holy water.")
[[And the woman looked at me.->CalmLeaveTest]] ]


:: The woman talked to me. {"position":"183,2252","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[The woman came up and talked to me.

I asked if was feeling better.


|skee>[She told me the guy was acting skeezy.]
(click: ?skee)[(set: $sequence to 1)(go-to: "The woman talked to me.")]
|garlic>[She ordered a LOT of garlic fries.]
(click: ?garlic)[(set: $sequence to 4)(go-to: "The woman talked to me.")]
|squirt>[She ordered the happy meal with the squirt gun prize.]
(click: ?squirt)[(set: $sequence to 6)(go-to: "The woman talked to me.")] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[She told me the guy had been totally inappropriate. Like, tripped her and called her a bitch.
(set: $sequence to 2)
I'm, um, I'm not really good at standing up for myself, but I REALLY HATE IT when people are rude to other people.

And this was my responsibility, since I was in charge of the McDonalds.

So I went over there and told him he had to leave.


[[Continue->The woman talked to me.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[And that's the strange part. The way he looked at me, he was //so angry//.

Like, way more angry than anyone should be to leave a McDonalds. Like, he wanted to hurt me angry.
(set: $sequence to 3)
And for just a second I was so scared. More scared than I've ever been.

I kind of blacked out. Not fainted or anything, just everything got blurry and like it was far away.

When I stopped freaking out, he was gone.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You banished the vampire by revoking his invitation.")

[[Continue->Weird Ignorance]] ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[She made like three orders of just garlic fries and ate them all.
(set: $sequence to 5)
I guess she liked garlic.

That's when things got freaky.


[[Continue->The woman talked to me.]]  ](elseif: $sequence is 5)[She walked over to the guy and hugged him. Just out of the blue.

And then he...bit her?

And then he started having a heart attack, or choking, and I couldn't remember what I was supposed to do when a customer was choking and the woman was on the ground and her neck was bleeding and he was //vomiting blood// and he was he was dissolving but that wasn't but that wasn't I...

I was screaming.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with garlic.")

[[The woman looked at me.->CalmLeaveTest]] ](elseif: $sequence is 6)[The woman seemed really happy about the squirt gun prize.
(set: $sequence to 7)
She left, and I forgot about that, until she came back and squirted the man with the gun.

And he MELTED.
(set: $TrueEnding to "You killed the vampire with a squirt gun.")

[[Continue->The woman talked to me.]] ](elseif: $sequence is 7)[So I start screaming, because there's a sociopath in my McDonalds squirting people with acid.

And she leaves, and I'm relieved, but also that's bad because she's //getting away.//

And I call 911 and an ambulance comes but the guy is already completely MELTED FROM ACID.


[[Continue->Therapy]] ]


:: Therapy {"position":"441,2498","size":"100,100"}
And then I went to therapy for ten years.


[[The End->Unlockables]]


:: Throw a bucket of holy water at him. {"position":"1988,2050","size":"100,100"}
