:: Throw holly success {"position":"1604,2153","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[I throw the holly like a Frisbee.
(set: $sequence to 1)
He's too distracted to dodge and it lands around his head like I just won a ring toss.
(set: $DeckTheHalls to true)
My prize is his expression as his ears burst into flames.


[[Continue->Throw holly success]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[He burns at the touch of the holy plant--very hot and very contained.
(set: $DeckTheHalls to true)
Every bit of him it touches turns into smoldering ash.
(set: $sequence to 2)
It starts at his head and trundles down his spine as his body and bones collapse around it.

It falls off when it reaches his hip, but by then he's dead.

[[I mean, for real this time.->death ending]] ]


:: Throw the holly wreath at him. {"position":"1596,2028","size":"100,100"}
I throw the holly like a Frisbee.

It's a good toss, but he sees what I'm doing and he dodges out of the way.


[[Uh oh.->Lucy_dies]]
(set: $death_hint to "Good idea with the holly, but he's faster than I am. I need to catch him while he's distracted.")


:: Time to eat. {"position":"900,1215","size":"100,100"}
I eat quickly so that I can get back to saving the world from the undead.(if: $current_meal is "Garlic Parmesan")[

I test my breath after eating the garlic fries. (if: $garlic_count is 1)[Faintly garlicky.](elseif: $garlic_count is 2)[Moderately garlicky.](else:)[VERY garlicky. I've got a lot of garlic in my bloodstream at this point.] ]


[[Now fortified by fast food, I rise, ready to do battle. And stuff.->Main Room]]


:: Tiring Work {"position":"101,321","size":"100,100"}
I know I don't handle the heavy lifting on this team.

Maggie does the one-two-ambush with stake and machete.

Luke shoots them with his grandad's holy musket and buries the bodies when there are bodies.

All |lucy>[I do,](click: ?lucy)[

//(I'm Lucy, by the way)//

] is stand for hours in dark alleys and smoky bars, trying to look helpless and delicious.

I'm not digging second hand graves. But waiting for something to come and try to eat you is its own kind of exhausting.

So I need a [[night off|Night Choices]].


:: True Ending {"position":"250,1748","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[My name is Claire.
(set: $sequence to 2)
I'm seventeen.

I work as a cashier at a McDonalds.

I'm...

Something happened tonight.


[[Continue->True Ending]] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)[I was working. My McDonalds is out on Evans street, on the edge of town.
(set: $sequence to 3)
Sue had ditched work. There were supposed to be two of us on site at all times, but she left.
(set: $tell_sequence to 0)
And, well, I wasn't going to [[tell on her.]]

I'd just have to [[do my best without her.->True Ending]] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)[Anyway.
(set: $sequence to 4)
I was there alone behind the counter.

But luckily hardly anyone comes in at night.

There was this one guy hanging out in a booth. He hadn't ordered anything.

But maybe he would soon.


[[Continue->True Ending]] ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[Then a pretty girl came in.
(set: $sequence to 5)
Her nails were...

