:: death by bite {"position":"2500,991","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[...I die.
(set: $sequence to 1)
I'm floating in a haze of endorphins. I almost don't notice as my blood-loss slips from dangerous to fatal down his gullet.

My heart stops seeing the point in beating.

My body drops to the ground, but I've already left it, joining the throng of restless spirits swirling around their murderer.

