Whatever he took out of me when he killed me so intimately.

(if: $garlic_count is 1 or $garlic_count is 2)[I am somewhat vindicated by the fact he is now on all fours, retching up my garlic-laced blood. But it's not strong enough to kill him.

]I'll be here, latched to him, until someone frees me by killing him.

Maybe Maggie will.

Maybe Luke.

I can't do anything anymore.

I watch as he walks back into the McDonalds.
