:: interview with vampire {"position":"2124,1912","size":"100,100"}
(if: $sequence is 0)[He slides into the booth across from me.

He tries to look deeply into my eyes.

I stare at his nose to avoid be mesmerized.
(set: $sequence to 1)

[[Continue.->interview with vampire]] ](elseif: $sequence is 1)[He smiles. Not quite wide enough for me to see his canines.

"You have a |greatBody>[great body].|greatBodySpace>[ ](click: ?greatBody)[(replace: ?greatBodySpace)["

//He opens with a compliment to establish a positive tone.//

"]]A little on the |heavy>[heavy side],|heavySpace>[ ](click: ?heavy)[(replace: ?heavySpace)["

//He insults me, targeting something he thinks I'm sensitive about. This will make me insecure and easier to manipulate.//

"]]but |like>[I like that]."|likeSpace>[ ](click: ?like)[(replace: ?likeSpace)[

//He ends with a psudo-compliment, making it hard for me to call him out for the insult, soothing the insecurity caused by the insult, and establishing himself as the authority on whether or not my body is likable.//]]


|flirtPass>[Flirt with him passively.](click: ?flirtPass)[(set: $sequence to 2)(go-to: "interview with vampire")]

|flirtAct>[Flirt with him assertively.](click: ?flirtAct)[(set: $sequence to 3)(go-to: "interview with vampire")]

|cig>[Light a cigarette and smile mysteriously.](click: ?cig)[(set: $sequence to 20)(set: $cig_lit to true)(go-to: "interview with vampire")]

(if: $inv_squirt_contains is "holy_water")[ [[Shoot him with my holy water squirt gun.]] ](else:)[  |squirt>[<span class="dimLink">Shoot him with my holy water squirt gun.</span>]    |squirtFail>[](click: ?squirt)[(replace: ?squirtFail)[//I don't have that.//] ] ]

[["Avaunt thee, nightgaunt, and tarnish not this hearth with your unholy presence."->not saying that]] ](elseif: $sequence is 20)[I light a cigarette, inhale some smoke, and smile at him.

The adorable cashier looks at me disapprovingly.

The vampire looks at me calculatingly, then leans towards me, tilting his body slightly away from the lit end of my cigarette.
(set: $sequence to 4)

[[Continue->interview with vampire]] ](elseif: $sequence is 2)["Oh. Uh. Thanks?"

I feign uncertainty. It's more important to seem vulnerable than enthusiastic.

He leans forward.
(set: $sequence to 4)

[[Continue->interview with vampire]] ](elseif: $sequence is 3)["Thanks," I say casually, smiling back. "You know, it's really brave of you to wear an outfit like that. But I think you make it work."

His eyebrows go up and he glances down at his clothes.

"...thank you," he says.
(set: $sequence to 4)

[[Continue->interview with vampire]] ](elseif: $sequence is 4)[He |touch>[touches my hand].(click: ?touch)[

//He enters my personal space, establishing intimacy, and does it without asking, establishing dominance.//]

(if: $mani_pedi_color is "none")["I like that outfit you've got on, but your |shoes>[shoes don't really match]."(click: ?shoes)[

//This is another compliment with a hook--he says something nice about my appearance, then criticizes it, keeping me off-balance.

FYI: My shoes do not match because I wear sneakers because my job involves running towards and away from vampires and they are comfy.//] ](else:)["Nice nails, |real>[are they real?]"(click: ?real)[

//This is another compliment with a hook--he says something nice about my appearance, then questions its authenticity, keeping me off-balance.//] ]


|flirtPass>[Flirt with him passively.](click: ?flirtPass)[(set: $sequence to 5)(go-to: "interview with vampire")]

|flirtAct>[Flirt with him assertively.](click: ?flirtAct)[(set: $sequence to 6)(go-to: "interview with vampire")](if: $cig_lit is true)[

|cig>[Smoke flirtatiously.](click: ?cig)[(set: $sequence to 21)(set: $cig_lit to true)(go-to: "interview with vampire")] ]

[["The bile of your words seduces not mine ears! My your tongue be ripped out and boiled."->not saying that]] ](elseif: $sequence is 21)[I smile as I blow a few smoke rings in his direction, continuing with the wordless mystique I have building up.

The adorable cashier glares at me.

I feel a little guilty.
(set: $sequence to 7)

[[Continue->interview with vampire]] ](elseif: $sequence is 5)[(if: $mani_pedi_color is "none")["Oh. Well I just, uh, threw this on."](else:)["Oh, well, sort of. I mean, I just had them done."]

I adjust my hair, contriving to let a few strands fall in front of my face. A little disarray helps my victim chic.
(set: $sequence to 7)

[[Continue->interview with vampire]] ](elseif: $sequence is 6)[(if: $mani_pedi_color is "none")[In response, I kick my sneakers off and start playing footsie with him under the table.

"Better?"](else:)["Yes," I grin. "Wanna feel?"]

He's taken aback for a moment, but recovers quickly.
(set: $sequence to 7)

[[Continue->interview with vampire]] ](elseif: $sequence is 7)["|pretty>[You're far too pretty for this place]," he tells me. (click: ?pretty)[

//He feels I am submissive or enthusiastic enough to progress to solid compliments now.//]

"I know a club down the block. |go>[Let's go there.]"(click: ?go)[

//He is trying to get me alone so he can murder and eat me.//]


|flirtPass>[Agree passively.](click: ?flirtPass)[(set: $sequence to 8)(go-to: "interview with vampire")]

|flirtAct>[Agree assertively.](click: ?flirtAct)[(set: $sequence to 9)(go-to: "interview with vampire")]

[["Know, fiend, that your cunning plot is foiled before it has even begun! I am not some fainting milksop, but a hunter of fel creatures, like yourself. I walk in darkness that others might live safely in the light. I fight with sword, and fire, and wit to rid the world of your menace."->not saying that 2]] ](elseif: $sequence is 8)["Oh! Okay."

I blush, fluttering my eyelids. It's over the top, but he laps it up.

I stand and let him lead me away from the table.
(set: $sequence to 0)

[[Continue.->Alley decide]] ](elseif: $sequence is 9)["That sounds great, but I have an even better idea," I tell him. "Follow me."

I stand and lead him away from the table.
(set: $sequence to 0)

[[Continue.->Alley decide]] ]


