(if: $towels_oily is true)[They go up! The oil makes them burn hot, and the paper towels let them burn for a while.](else:)[They burn for a little while.]

The plastic floor melts a little, but doesn't catch.
(set: $fire_tried to true)

[[Try something else.->Set the building on fire.]] ](elseif: $currently_burning is "every")[I make a number of nests of (if: $towels_oily is true)[oily ]paper towels around the room.

I use ten paper towels.
(set: $inv_paper_count to $inv_paper_count-10)
One by one I light them.

(if: $towels_oily is true)[They go up! The oil makes them burn hot, and the paper towels let them burn for a while.

One of the tables catches fire!

Another table catches fire!

The fire spreads in front of the door!
(set: $death_hint to "Well I just burned to death. Next time, maybe be a little less enthusiastic with the fire placement.")
[[...Shit.->Endings]] ](else:)[They burn for a little while, but not intensely enough that anything else catches.

//This looks easier in movies.//

Anyway. The paper towels are a good idea, but I think they need a little more something-something if we're going to do arson with them.


[[Something else then.->Set the building on fire.]] ] ](elseif: $currently_burning is "table")[I make a nest of (if: $towels_oily is true)[oily ]paper towels on one of the tables.

I use ten paper towels.
(set: $inv_paper_count to $inv_paper_count-10)
I light it with my Zippo.

(if: $towels_oily is true)[They go up! The oil makes them burn hot, and the paper towels let them burn for a while.

The plastic coating of the table melts, and the pressed wooden core starts burning.

I have a merry consistent flame that's strong enough not to die when the sprinklers come on.


[[Continue->fire alarm]] ](else:)[They burn for a little while, but not intensely enough that the table catches.

//This looks easier in movies.//

Anyway. The paper towels are a good idea, but I think they need a little more something-something if we're going to do arson with them.


[[Something else then.->Set the building on fire.]] ] ](elseif: $currently_burning is "counter")[I make a nest of (if: $towels_oily is true)[oily ]paper towels on the counter.

I use ten paper towels.
(set: $inv_paper_count to $inv_paper_count-10)
I light it with my Zippo.

(if: $towels_oily is true)[They go up! The oil makes them burn hot, and the paper towels let them burn for a while.

The plastic coating of the counter melts, and the pressed wooden core starts burning.

I have a merry consistent flame that's strong enough not to die when the sprinklers come on.


[[Continue->fire alarm death]] ](else:)[They burn for a little while, but not intensely enough that the counter catches.

