:: wait alley {"position":"2247,1252","size":"100,100"}
I stand and wait. The vampire takes the opportunity to bite me.

Vampire bites are funky things. They have narcotics on their fangs.

That's why the girls in the old Gothic horrors are always fainting and lolling in the monster's clutches. They're not unconscious. They're doped up.

I'm not going to be able to do much of anything while high on vampire spit. I can only hope whatever plan I set in motion [[before...->wait alley plan]]


